  "body": "## 0.0.17 - 2026-08-21\n\n### 其他\n- 本仓库只保留 Grok Build 生成物 (`repo`) ([`3d501e5`](https://github.com/StringKe/std-agent/commit/3d501e5d8ddfc4aed7c59dbd9f747848b64293e5))\n\n### 文档\n- Align all locales with 25 targets and gitignore examples (`readme`) ([`57d146b`](https://github.com/StringKe/std-agent/commit/57d146baa614161614c2df139a365365f8bec0f6))\n\n### 新增\n- 新增 Zed 与 Junie，移除停更 target 并收窄本仓库同步范围 (`transformer`) ([`5736b33`](https://github.com/StringKe/std-agent/commit/5736b3321f3348f9fcb4495529582b1ea976a179))\n\n"
